<title>BELGIUM: ACTIVCARD LINKS WITH SCHLUMBERGER .</title>
<headline>ACTIVCARD LINKS WITH SCHLUMBERGER .</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Easdaq-listed French smart card maker ActivCard said on Wednesday it had entered into a technological alliance with the electronic commerce units of U.S. conglomerate Schlumberger Ltd .</p>
<p>&quot;The spectrum of products made available by this agreement is expected to provide ready-to-use security tools to enable many emerging electronic commerce applications including home banking and shopping, secure e-mail and corporate communications over the Internet, corporate intranets and other telecommunication networks,&quot; ActivCard said in a statement.</p>
<p>Financial terms or details were not given.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
